    VERIFY SQL "COMMIT" WAS CALLED 1 TIMES
    VERIFY SQL "COMMIT" WAS CALLED 1 TIMES
    VERIFY CLOSE ACHFILE WAS CALLED 1 TIMES
    VERIFY CLOSE ACHRETURN WAS CALLED 1 TIMES
    VERIFY CLOSE ACHRPT WAS CALLED 1 TIMES
    VERIFY CLOSE PARMFILE WAS CALLED 1 TIMES

